## Root Cause Analysis

### The Latch Mechanism (extension.js line ~827)

```javascript
close(t=!1){
    return this._closingPromise===void 0&&(
        this._cancelledByUser=t,  // ← SET TO TRUE HERE
        this._closingPromise=(async()=>{
            // cleanup code
        })()
    ),
    this._closingPromise
}

async callTool(t,r,n,i,o){
